{"sha": "ad49aa5f68da21a10cbbf5e9f1aecb8b5cd1b9a33be5730d44a5e37149247947", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omie, width=0.82\\linewidth, height=5.6cm, xmin=-1.2, xmax=0.8,", "  ymin=-2, ymax=2, xlabel={$E$ (V)}, ylabel={$i$}, clip=true, clip mode=individual]", "\\addplot[omanodic] table[x=E, y=i] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-ie-curves-h-neg.dat};", "\\addplot[omcathodic] table[x=E, y=i] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-ie-curves-h-pos.dat};", "\\draw[densely dashed, gray] (axis cs:-1.2,1) -- (axis cs:0.8,1);", "\\draw[densely dashed, gray] (axis cs:-1.2,-1) -- (axis cs:0.8,-1);", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, gray, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:-1.18,1) {$+I$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, gray, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:-1.18,-1) {$-I$};", "\\fill (axis cs:-0.730,1) circle (1.3pt); \\fill (axis cs:0.210,-1) circle (1.3pt);", "\\draw[densely dotted] (axis cs:-0.85,0) -- (axis cs:-0.85,0.5);", "\\draw[densely dotted] (axis cs:0.45,0) -- (axis cs:0.45,-0.5);", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south] at (axis cs:-0.85,0.5) {$E_-$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=north] at (axis cs:0.45,-0.5) {$E_+$};", "\\draw[<->, thick, omProp] (axis cs:-0.730,1.5) -- (axis cs:0.210,1.5) node[midway, above, font=\\scriptsize] {$U + rI$};", "\\draw[densely dotted] (axis cs:-0.730,1) -- (axis cs:-0.730,1.5);", "\\draw[densely dotted] (axis cs:0.210,-1) -- (axis cs:0.210,1.5);", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm, anchor=west] at (axis cs:-0.70,0.6) {负极};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, anchor=west] at (axis cs:0.30,-1.5) {正极};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 电池的工作点（模型曲线）。在电流 $I$ 下，负极", "位于其阳极曲线上，正极位于其阴极曲线上；两极电势之差，", "减去欧姆降 $rI$，即为输出电压。", "它随 $I$ 增大而下降。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[电池或电解槽的工作点]\\label{met:b2:batteries-electrolysis:operating-point}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 画出被氧化的电极的阳极曲线，以及", "        被还原的电极的阴极曲线。", "  \\item 对于电流 $I$，读取各电极的电势：在 $+I$ 处取阳极曲线上的值，", "        在 $-I$ 处取阴极曲线上的值。", "  \\item 两极电势之差经 $rI$ 修正（电池中减去，", "        电解槽中加上），即为电压。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{example}[铅酸蓄电池]\\label{ex:b2:batteries-electrolysis:lead}", "负极上 \\ce{Pb + SO4^2- -> PbSO4 + 2e-}；正极上", "为 \\ce{PbO2 + 4H+ + SO4^2- + 2e- -> PbSO4 + 2H2O}。总反应为", "\\[", "  \\ce{Pb + PbO2 + 4H+ + 2SO4^2- -> 2PbSO4 + 2H2O},", "\\]", "$\\Delta_r G^\\circ = 2(-813.14) + 2(-237.13) - (-217.33) - 2(-744.53) =", "\\qty{-394.1}{kJ/mol}$, $E^\\circ = 394\\,100/(2 \\times 96\\,485) = \\qty{2.04}{V}$.", "放电时两极均被硫酸铅覆盖，充电则", "使反应逆转。铅上 \\ce{H+} 的还原与二氧化铅上", "水的氧化都很慢，这正是 \\qty{2}{V} 的电池能在", "水中充电的原因，水的热力学窗口宽度仅为 \\qty{1.23}{V}。", "% ledger: dfg:PbSO4_cr, dfg:H2O_l, dfg:PbO2_cr, dfg:SO42-_ao", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (6,3.2);", "  \\fill[omDef!10] (0.05,0.05) rectangle (5.95,2.7);", "  \\fill[black!45] (0.6,0.4) rectangle (1.1,2.9);", "  \\fill[brown!60!black] (4.9,0.4) rectangle (5.4,2.9);", "  \\draw[thick] (0.85,2.9) -- (0.85,3.9) node[pos=0.75, left] {$-$};", "  \\draw[thick] (5.15,2.9) -- (5.15,3.9) node[pos=0.75, right] {$+$};", "  \\draw[->, thick, omProp] (0.85,3.9) -- (0.85,4.3) -- (5.15,4.3) -- (5.15,3.95);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, omProp, anchor=south] at (3,4.3) {放电时 $\\mathrm{e^-}$};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, align=center] at (0.85,-0.45) {\\ce{Pb}\\\\ （放电时为 \\ce{PbSO4}）};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, align=center] at (5.15,-0.45) {\\ce{PbO2}\\\\ （放电时为 \\ce{PbSO4}）};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, align=center] at (3.0,1.6) {\\ce{H2SO4} 溶液\\\\ \\ce{H+}、\\ce{HSO4-}、\\ce{SO4^2-}};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 铅酸蓄电池示意图。放电时，铅被氧化，", "二者均被还原为硫酸铅，硫酸被消耗：", "溶液的密度可指示充电状态。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, >={Stealth}]", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) rectangle (7,3);", "  % graphite layers", "  \\foreach \\y in {0.5,0.9,1.3,1.7,2.1,2.5} \\draw[thick, black!70] (0.3,\\y) -- (2.3,\\y);", "  \\foreach \\y in {0.7,1.1,1.5,1.9,2.3} \\foreach \\x in {0.6,1.3,2.0} \\fill[omDef] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.07);", "  % layered oxide", "  \\foreach \\y in {0.5,0.9,1.3,1.7,2.1,2.5} \\draw[thick, omThm] (4.7,\\y) -- (6.7,\\y);", "  \\foreach \\y in {0.7,1.5,2.3} \\foreach \\x in {5.0,5.7,6.4} \\fill[omDef] (\\x,\\y) circle (0.07);", "  \\draw[densely dashed] (3.5,0) -- (3.5,3);", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, align=center] at (1.3,-0.45) {石墨（负极）};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, align=center] at (5.7,-0.45) {层状氧化物（正极）};", "  \\node[font=\\scriptsize, anchor=south] at (3.5,3.0) {隔膜};", "  \\draw[->, thick, omThm] (2.5,2.1) -- (4.5,2.1) node[midway, above, font=\\scriptsize, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {\\ce{Li+} 放电时};", "  \\draw[<-, thick, omDef] (2.5,0.9) -- (4.5,0.9) node[midway, below, font=\\scriptsize, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {\\ce{Li+} 充电时};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 锂离子电池示意图。锂离子（蓝点）位于充电后的电池中", "石墨层之间；放电时，它们穿过", "电解质，嵌入金属氧化物的层间，同时电子经外电路流动，", "两极既不溶解也不沉积：", "离子在两种宿主之间往返穿梭。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{history}[伏打电堆]", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.27\\linewidth}", "\\vspace{0pt}", "\\includegraphics[width=\\linewidth]{images/book3/volta-pile.jpg}", "\\end{minipage}\\hfill", "\\begin{minipage}[t]{0.69\\linewidth}", "\\vspace{0pt}", "1800 年，亚历山德罗·伏打描述了一根由两种不同金属圆片叠成的柱，", "圆片分别为锌与铜或银，中间以浸过盐水的布隔开：这是第一个", "能提供稳定电流的电源。数周之内，他人便用它分解水；", "十年之内，汉弗莱·戴维用大型电堆，", "电解其熔融氢氧化物，分离出钠和钾。照片所示为", "伏打本人所制电堆之一。（照片：GuidoB，CC BY-SA 3.0，Wikimedia", "Commons。）", "\\end{minipage}", "\\end{history}", ""]}